{"id":"c73f993fd95bf602","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-rational-code.md","title":"Canonical Rational Number Codes","display":"df-rational-code — Canonical Rational Number Codes","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-rational-code","aliases":["62-df-rational-code"],"display":"df-rational-code — Canonical Rational Number Codes","depends_on":["[[62-df-coded-function]]","[[62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion]]","[[62-df-finite-sequence]]","[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-L2]]","[[62-df-derivability]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition II.4.2","source_pages":[74],"source_pdf_pages":[92]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-rational-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-rational-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rational-code — Canonical Rational Number Codes"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5b467a42733b7257\" href=\"?note=5b467a42733b7257\" title=\"62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion\">62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition II.4.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>74</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>数值配对见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>；有限幂运算的函数图由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5b467a42733b7257\" href=\"?note=5b467a42733b7257\" title=\"62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion\">62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion</a> 提供。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,d,q,r,s,u\">\\(a,b,c,d,q,r,s,u\\)</span> 为数变量。下面的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 只对标准自然数原始代码作元层有理数解释；非标准数域中的代码不通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 映入外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q\">\\(\\mathbb Q\\)</span>。对象语言始终操作数代码。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 所在的元层式中，原始码判定与数值配对均在标准自然数上解释。</p>\n<p>下述有理运算符只在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Q_c\">\\(\\mathbb Q_c\\)</span> 输入上使用，等式表示对应的唯一输出关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_k\">\\(\\varepsilon_k\\)</span> 与有理幂缩写的下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in N\">\\(k\\in N\\)</span>。自然数倍有理数采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nat}_Q\">\\(\\operatorname{nat}_Q\\)</span>，不把自然数代码大小当作有理值大小。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RatCode}\">\\(\\mathsf{RatCode}\\)</span> 是原始有理码谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Norm}_Q\">\\(\\mathsf{Norm}_Q\\)</span> 是正规化关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{norm}_Q\">\\(\\operatorname{norm}_Q\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RatCode}\">\\(\\mathsf{RatCode}\\)</span> 域上取唯一值。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)\">\\(\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b7164631e6f56192\" href=\"?note=b7164631e6f56192\" title=\"62-df-finite-sequence\">62-df-finite-sequence</a> 的内部序列码；指数的下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 是对象数。函数图的存在唯一性和有理域所需的运算性质在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a> 中使用，推导关系与 UC 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"98c3cbeb95500b53\" href=\"?note=98c3cbeb95500b53\" title=\"62-df-derivability\">62-df-derivability</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rational\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)&amp;\\leftrightarrow c&gt;0\\land q=\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N,\\\\\n\\mathsf{RatEq}(q,r)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b,c,d,a&#39;,b&#39;\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a&#39;,b&#39;,d)\\land ad+b&#39;c=bd+a&#39;c],\\\\\n\\mathsf{RatLt}(q,r)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b,c,d,a&#39;,b&#39;\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a&#39;,b&#39;,d)\\land ad+b&#39;c&lt;bd+a&#39;c],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rat}(q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(\\exists a,b,c\\le q\\;\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c))\\land\\forall u&lt;q\\;\\neg\\mathsf{RatEq}(q,u),\\\\\n\\mathbb Q_c&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q:\\mathsf{Rat}(q)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b,c\\le q\\ \\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Norm}_Q(q,r)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)\\land r\\le q\\land\\mathsf{Rat}(r)\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(q,r),\\\\\n\\operatorname{norm}_Q(q)=r&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Norm}_Q(q,r).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rational\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)&amp;\\leftrightarrow c&gt;0\\land q=\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N,\\\\\n\\mathsf{RatEq}(q,r)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b,c,d,a&#39;,b&#39;\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a&#39;,b&#39;,d)\\land ad+b&#39;c=bd+a&#39;c],\\\\\n\\mathsf{RatLt}(q,r)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b,c,d,a&#39;,b&#39;\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a&#39;,b&#39;,d)\\land ad+b&#39;c&lt;bd+a&#39;c],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rat}(q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow(\\exists a,b,c\\le q\\;\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c))\\land\\forall u&lt;q\\;\\neg\\mathsf{RatEq}(q,u),\\\\\n\\mathbb Q_c&amp;\\coloneqq\\{q:\\mathsf{Rat}(q)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b,c\\le q\\ \\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Norm}_Q(q,r)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)\\land r\\le q\\land\\mathsf{Rat}(r)\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(q,r),\\\\\n\\operatorname{norm}_Q(q)=r&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Norm}_Q(q,r).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu:\\{q\\in\\mathbb N:\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)\\}\\longrightarrow\\mathbb Q,\\qquad\n\\nu(\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N)\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(a)-\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(b)}{\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(c)}\n\\quad(a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N,\\ c&gt;0),\\qquad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}:\\mathbb N\\longrightarrow\\mathbb Q,\\qquad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(0)=0_{\\mathbb Q},\\quad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(n+1)=\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(n)+1_{\\mathbb Q}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu:\\{q\\in\\mathbb N:\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)\\}\\longrightarrow\\mathbb Q,\\qquad\n\\nu(\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N)\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(a)-\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(b)}{\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(c)}\n\\quad(a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N,\\ c&gt;0),\\qquad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}:\\mathbb N\\longrightarrow\\mathbb Q,\\qquad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(0)=0_{\\mathbb Q},\\quad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(n+1)=\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(n)+1_{\\mathbb Q}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q&lt;_Q r\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{RatLt}(q,r),\\qquad q\\le_Q r\\leftrightarrow(q&lt;_Q r\\lor q=r)\\qquad(q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q&lt;_Q r\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{RatLt}(q,r),\\qquad q\\le_Q r\\leftrightarrow(q&lt;_Q r\\lor q=r)\\qquad(q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,r,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;q,r,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land\\exists a,b,c,a&#39;,b&#39;,d\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a&#39;,b&#39;,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(s,\\langle\\langle ad+a&#39;c,bd+b&#39;c\\rangle_N,cd\\rangle_N)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;q,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land\\exists a,b,c\\le q\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(s,\\langle\\langle b,a\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Mul}_Q(q,r,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;q,r,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land\\exists a,b,c,a&#39;,b&#39;,d\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a&#39;,b&#39;,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(s,\\langle\\langle aa&#39;+bb&#39;,ab&#39;+ba&#39;\\rangle_N,cd\\rangle_N)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Sub}_Q(q,r,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists u\\;(\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(r,u)\\land\\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,u,s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Abs}_Q(q,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;q,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land[(0_Q\\le_Q q\\land s=q)\\lor(q&lt;_Q0_Q\\land\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s))],\\\\\n0_Q&amp;=1,\\qquad1_Q=11,\\\\\n\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)=k+1\n\\land s(0)=1\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\ s(i+1)=2s(i),\\\\\nE(k)=m&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\,[\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)\\land s(k)=m],\\\\\nE(0)&amp;=1,\\qquad E(k+1)=2E(k),\\\\\n\\varepsilon_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{norm}_Q(\\langle\\langle1,0\\rangle_N,E(k)\\rangle_N).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,r,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;q,r,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land\\exists a,b,c,a&#39;,b&#39;,d\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a&#39;,b&#39;,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(s,\\langle\\langle ad+a&#39;c,bd+b&#39;c\\rangle_N,cd\\rangle_N)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;q,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land\\exists a,b,c\\le q\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(s,\\langle\\langle b,a\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Mul}_Q(q,r,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;q,r,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land\\exists a,b,c,a&#39;,b&#39;,d\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a&#39;,b&#39;,d)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(s,\\langle\\langle aa&#39;+bb&#39;,ab&#39;+ba&#39;\\rangle_N,cd\\rangle_N)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Sub}_Q(q,r,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\exists u\\;(\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(r,u)\\land\\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,u,s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Abs}_Q(q,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;q,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land[(0_Q\\le_Q q\\land s=q)\\lor(q&lt;_Q0_Q\\land\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s))],\\\\\n0_Q&amp;=1,\\qquad1_Q=11,\\\\\n\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)=k+1\n\\land s(0)=1\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\ s(i+1)=2s(i),\\\\\nE(k)=m&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\,[\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)\\land s(k)=m],\\\\\nE(0)&amp;=1,\\qquad E(k+1)=2E(k),\\\\\n\\varepsilon_k&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{norm}_Q(\\langle\\langle1,0\\rangle_N,E(k)\\rangle_N).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nq+_Qr=s&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,r,s),\\\\\n-_Qq=s&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s),\\\\\nq-_Qr=s&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Sub}_Q(q,r,s),\\\\\nq\\cdot_Qr=s&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Mul}_Q(q,r,s),\\\\\n|q|_Q=s&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Abs}_Q(q,s),\\\\\n|q-r|_Q&amp;\\coloneqq|q-_Qr|_Q,\\\\\n\\operatorname{nat}_Q(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{norm}_Q(\\langle\\langle n,0\\rangle_N,1\\rangle_N),\\\\\n2\\varepsilon_k&amp;\\;:\\!\\equiv\\;\\operatorname{nat}_Q(2)\\cdot_Q\\varepsilon_k,\\\\\n2^{-k}&amp;\\;:\\!\\equiv\\;\\varepsilon_k,\\quad\n2^{1-k}\\;:\\!\\equiv\\;\\operatorname{nat}_Q(2)\\cdot_Q\\varepsilon_k,\\\\\n\\min_Q(q,r)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}q&amp;q\\le_Qr,\\\\r&amp;r&lt;_Qq,\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\max_Q(q,r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}r&amp;q\\le_Qr,\\\\q&amp;r&lt;_Qq,\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nq+_Qr=s&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,r,s),\\\\\n-_Qq=s&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s),\\\\\nq-_Qr=s&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Sub}_Q(q,r,s),\\\\\nq\\cdot_Qr=s&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Mul}_Q(q,r,s),\\\\\n|q|_Q=s&amp;\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Abs}_Q(q,s),\\\\\n|q-r|_Q&amp;\\coloneqq|q-_Qr|_Q,\\\\\n\\operatorname{nat}_Q(n)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{norm}_Q(\\langle\\langle n,0\\rangle_N,1\\rangle_N),\\\\\n2\\varepsilon_k&amp;\\;:\\!\\equiv\\;\\operatorname{nat}_Q(2)\\cdot_Q\\varepsilon_k,\\\\\n2^{-k}&amp;\\;:\\!\\equiv\\;\\varepsilon_k,\\quad\n2^{1-k}\\;:\\!\\equiv\\;\\operatorname{nat}_Q(2)\\cdot_Q\\varepsilon_k,\\\\\n\\min_Q(q,r)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}q&amp;q\\le_Qr,\\\\r&amp;r&lt;_Qq,\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\max_Q(q,r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}r&amp;q\\le_Qr,\\\\q&amp;r&lt;_Qq,\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\forall q\\,[\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)\\to\\exists!r\\ \\mathsf{Norm}_Q(q,r)]\\land\n\\forall k\\exists!s\\ \\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\exists G\\,[\\mathsf{Fun}(G,N,N)\\land\\forall k,m\\,(G(k)=m\\leftrightarrow E(k)=m)]\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&amp;\n(\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,r,s))\\land\\\\\n&amp; (\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Mul}_Q(q,r,s))\\land\\\\\n&amp; (\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Sub}_Q(q,r,s))\\land\\\\\n&amp; (\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s))\\land\\\\\n&amp; (\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Abs}_Q(q,s))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\forall q\\,[\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)\\to\\exists!r\\ \\mathsf{Norm}_Q(q,r)]\\land\n\\forall k\\exists!s\\ \\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&amp;\n\\exists G\\,[\\mathsf{Fun}(G,N,N)\\land\\forall k,m\\,(G(k)=m\\leftrightarrow E(k)=m)]\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&amp;\n(\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,r,s))\\land\\\\\n&amp; (\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Mul}_Q(q,r,s))\\land\\\\\n&amp; (\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Sub}_Q(q,r,s))\\land\\\\\n&amp; (\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s))\\land\\\\\n&amp; (\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Abs}_Q(q,s))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个有理值取等值 Raw 代码的最小者。分母正的交叉乘法避免对象语言中的负自然数。与 II.4.2 的“取最小三元组代码”方案有效对应；这里显式固定三元组的嵌套配对次序。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+_Q,-_Q,\\cdot_Q,|\\cdot|_Q\">\\(+_Q,-_Q,\\cdot_Q,|\\cdot|_Q\\)</span> 是 Add、Sub、Mul、Abs 的唯一输出缩写。运算先形成一个 Raw 结果，然后有界最小化；因此其图在 RCA₀ 中存在。E 的图由内部有限倍增运行生成；正规化关系显式包含原始码、规范输出和有界代表条件。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{-k}\">\\(2^{-k}\\)</span> 作有理值时指 εₖ，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{1-k}\">\\(2^{1-k}\\)</span> 指 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_Q+_Q1_Q\">\\(1_Q+_Q1_Q\\)</span> 与 εₖ 的有理积。常数实采用这些有理代码；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 仅说明外部解释，不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_2\">\\(L_2\\)</span> 的新函数符号。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition II.4.2；纸面页 74；PDF 页 92。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"5b467a42733b7257","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-finite-sequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-L2]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-derivability]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数值配对见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；有限幂运算的函数图由 [[62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion]] 提供。$a,b,c,d,q,r,s,u$ 为数变量。下面的 $\\nu$ 只对标准自然数原始代码作元层有理数解释；非标准数域中的代码不通过 $\\nu$ 映入外部 $\\mathbb Q$。对象语言始终操作数代码。$\\nu$ 所在的元层式中，原始码判定与数值配对均在标准自然数上解释。","embed":false},{"target":"62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"5b467a42733b7257","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"数值配对见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；有限幂运算的函数图由 [[62-thm-RCA0-primitive-recursion]] 提供。$a,b,c,d,q,r,s,u$ 为数变量。下面的 $\\nu$ 只对标准自然数原始代码作元层有理数解释；非标准数域中的代码不通过 $\\nu$ 映入外部 $\\mathbb Q$。对象语言始终操作数代码。$\\nu$ 所在的元层式中，原始码判定与数值配对均在标准自然数上解释。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-finite-sequence","status":"resolved","id":"b7164631e6f56192","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{RatCode}$ 是原始有理码谓词，$\\mathsf{Norm}_Q$ 是正规化关系，$\\operatorname{norm}_Q$ 仅在 $\\mathsf{RatCode}$ 域上取唯一值。$\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)$ 使用 [[62-df-finite-sequence]] 的内部序列码；指数的下标 $k$ 是对象数。函数图的存在唯一性和有理域所需的运算性质在 [[62-df-RCA0]] 中使用，推导关系与 UC 见 [[62-df-derivability]]、[[62-df-L2]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{RatCode}$ 是原始有理码谓词，$\\mathsf{Norm}_Q$ 是正规化关系，$\\operatorname{norm}_Q$ 仅在 $\\mathsf{RatCode}$ 域上取唯一值。$\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)$ 使用 [[62-df-finite-sequence]] 的内部序列码；指数的下标 $k$ 是对象数。函数图的存在唯一性和有理域所需的运算性质在 [[62-df-RCA0]] 中使用，推导关系与 UC 见 [[62-df-derivability]]、[[62-df-L2]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-derivability","status":"resolved","id":"98c3cbeb95500b53","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{RatCode}$ 是原始有理码谓词，$\\mathsf{Norm}_Q$ 是正规化关系，$\\operatorname{norm}_Q$ 仅在 $\\mathsf{RatCode}$ 域上取唯一值。$\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)$ 使用 [[62-df-finite-sequence]] 的内部序列码；指数的下标 $k$ 是对象数。函数图的存在唯一性和有理域所需的运算性质在 [[62-df-RCA0]] 中使用，推导关系与 UC 见 [[62-df-derivability]]、[[62-df-L2]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-L2","status":"resolved","id":"4c6d2d9f1999915f","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathsf{RatCode}$ 是原始有理码谓词，$\\mathsf{Norm}_Q$ 是正规化关系，$\\operatorname{norm}_Q$ 仅在 $\\mathsf{RatCode}$ 域上取唯一值。$\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)$ 使用 [[62-df-finite-sequence]] 的内部序列码；指数的下标 $k$ 是对象数。函数图的存在唯一性和有理域所需的运算性质在 [[62-df-RCA0]] 中使用，推导关系与 UC 见 [[62-df-derivability]]、[[62-df-L2]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a,b,c,d,q,r,s,u","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Q_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon_k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nat}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RatCode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Norm}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{norm}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RatCode}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rational\\text{-}code}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)&\\leftrightarrow c>0\\land q=\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N,\\\\\n\\mathsf{RatEq}(q,r)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b,c,d,a',b'\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a',b',d)\\land ad+b'c=bd+a'c],\\\\\n\\mathsf{RatLt}(q,r)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b,c,d,a',b'\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a',b',d)\\land ad+b'c<bd+a'c],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Rat}(q)&\\leftrightarrow(\\exists a,b,c\\le q\\;\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c))\\land\\forall u<q\\;\\neg\\mathsf{RatEq}(q,u),\\\\\n\\mathbb Q_c&\\coloneqq\\{q:\\mathsf{Rat}(q)\\},\\\\\n\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)&\\leftrightarrow\\exists a,b,c\\le q\\ \\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Norm}_Q(q,r)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)\\land r\\le q\\land\\mathsf{Rat}(r)\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(q,r),\\\\\n\\operatorname{norm}_Q(q)=r&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Norm}_Q(q,r).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu:\\{q\\in\\mathbb N:\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)\\}\\longrightarrow\\mathbb Q,\\qquad\n\\nu(\\langle\\langle a,b\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N)\\coloneqq\n\\frac{\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(a)-\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(b)}{\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(c)}\n\\quad(a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N,\\ c>0),\\qquad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}:\\mathbb N\\longrightarrow\\mathbb Q,\\qquad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(0)=0_{\\mathbb Q},\\quad\n\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(n+1)=\\iota_{\\mathbb N,\\mathbb Q}(n)+1_{\\mathbb Q}.","display":true},{"tex":"q<_Q r\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{RatLt}(q,r),\\qquad q\\le_Q r\\leftrightarrow(q<_Q r\\lor q=r)\\qquad(q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,r,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&q,r,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land\\exists a,b,c,a',b',d\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a',b',d)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(s,\\langle\\langle ad+a'c,bd+b'c\\rangle_N,cd\\rangle_N)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&q,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land\\exists a,b,c\\le q\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(s,\\langle\\langle b,a\\rangle_N,c\\rangle_N)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Mul}_Q(q,r,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&q,r,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land\\exists a,b,c,a',b',d\\le q+r\\;[\\mathsf{RatRaw}(q;a,b,c)\\land\\mathsf{RatRaw}(r;a',b',d)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathsf{RatEq}(s,\\langle\\langle aa'+bb',ab'+ba'\\rangle_N,cd\\rangle_N)],\\\\\n\\mathsf{Sub}_Q(q,r,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\exists u\\;(\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(r,u)\\land\\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,u,s)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Abs}_Q(q,s)\\leftrightarrow{}&q,s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\land[(0_Q\\le_Q q\\land s=q)\\lor(q<_Q0_Q\\land\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s))],\\\\\n0_Q&=1,\\qquad1_Q=11,\\\\\n\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)&\\leftrightarrow\\mathsf{Seq}(s)\\land\\operatorname{lh}(s)=k+1\n\\land s(0)=1\\land\\forall i<k\\ s(i+1)=2s(i),\\\\\nE(k)=m&\\leftrightarrow\\exists s\\,[\\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)\\land s(k)=m],\\\\\nE(0)&=1,\\qquad E(k+1)=2E(k),\\\\\n\\varepsilon_k&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{norm}_Q(\\langle\\langle1,0\\rangle_N,E(k)\\rangle_N).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nq+_Qr=s&\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,r,s),\\\\\n-_Qq=s&\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s),\\\\\nq-_Qr=s&\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Sub}_Q(q,r,s),\\\\\nq\\cdot_Qr=s&\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Mul}_Q(q,r,s),\\\\\n|q|_Q=s&\\;:\\!\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\mathsf{Abs}_Q(q,s),\\\\\n|q-r|_Q&\\coloneqq|q-_Qr|_Q,\\\\\n\\operatorname{nat}_Q(n)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{norm}_Q(\\langle\\langle n,0\\rangle_N,1\\rangle_N),\\\\\n2\\varepsilon_k&\\;:\\!\\equiv\\;\\operatorname{nat}_Q(2)\\cdot_Q\\varepsilon_k,\\\\\n2^{-k}&\\;:\\!\\equiv\\;\\varepsilon_k,\\quad\n2^{1-k}\\;:\\!\\equiv\\;\\operatorname{nat}_Q(2)\\cdot_Q\\varepsilon_k,\\\\\n\\min_Q(q,r)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}q&q\\le_Qr,\\\\r&r<_Qq,\\end{cases}\\quad\n\\max_Q(q,r)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}r&q\\le_Qr,\\\\q&r<_Qq,\\end{cases}\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&\n\\forall q\\,[\\mathsf{RatCode}(q)\\to\\exists!r\\ \\mathsf{Norm}_Q(q,r)]\\land\n\\forall k\\exists!s\\ \\mathsf{ExpRun}(k,s)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&\n\\exists G\\,[\\mathsf{Fun}(G,N,N)\\land\\forall k,m\\,(G(k)=m\\leftrightarrow E(k)=m)]\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{RCA}_0\\vdash_{S_2}\\operatorname{UC}\\Bigl[&\n(\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Add}_Q(q,r,s))\\land\\\\\n& (\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Mul}_Q(q,r,s))\\land\\\\\n& (\\forall q,r\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Sub}_Q(q,r,s))\\land\\\\\n& (\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Neg}_Q(q,s))\\land\\\\\n& (\\forall q\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\exists!s\\in\\mathbb Q_c\\ \\mathsf{Abs}_Q(q,s))\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"+_Q,-_Q,\\cdot_Q,|\\cdot|_Q","display":false},{"tex":"2^{-k}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{1-k}","display":false},{"tex":"1_Q+_Q1_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"L_2","display":false}],"bytes":6834,"backlinks":[{"id":"2d906890ee12a65d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal A=(A,D),\\mathcal B=(B,E)$ 的结构见 [[62-df-metric-presentation]]；$\\ll_{\\mathcal A},\\ll_{\\mathcal B},\\mathbb Q_c^+$ 见 [[62-df-metric-open-code]]；配对见 [[62-df-coded-function]]，有理加法见 [[62-df-rational-code]]。$\\kappa$ 是 Assertion 中的五元数码构造器。量化的球变量均在 $A\\times\\mathbb Q_c^+$ 或 $B\\times\\mathbb Q_c^+$ 中；$\\Phi$ 为数集。"},{"id":"166ca19259ae8ea6","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\mathcal A=(A,D)$，见 [[62-df-metric-presentation]]；点及常值点见 [[62-df-metric-point]]，距离见 [[62-df-metric-distance]]，配对见 [[62-df-coded-function]]，有理序见 [[62-df-rational-code]]，实加法见 [[62-df-real-operations]]。$n,a,r$ 为数变量；正半径域和三元数码构造器在 Assertion 中定义。"},{"id":"27c74b34b89e9595","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A,D$ 为数集；$\\mathcal A=(A,D)$ 是元层结构记号，不是对象语言中的集合有序对。函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]，有理代码见 [[62-df-rational-code]]，快实代码和序见 [[62-df-real-code]]，加法见 [[62-df-real-operations]]。$D_{ab}$ 由 Assertion 的图成员式定义；在 D 满足 Met 中的总函数条件时，它是相应距离的实代码。"},{"id":"4be7be9270ef359a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbb Q_c,\\mathsf{Add}_Q,\\mathsf{Mul}_Q,\\mathsf{Neg}_Q,0_Q=1,1_Q=11$ 见 [[62-df-rational-code]]；域元组格式见 [[62-df-countable-field]]；配对与函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$\\mathcal Q$ 及其三个运算图在 Assertion 中引入。"},{"id":"1c2651cdb8ccb9a3","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"Met 与距离图的格式见 [[62-df-metric-presentation]]，点见 [[62-df-metric-point]]，有理差、绝对值及代码见 [[62-df-rational-code]]，实代码与常数实见 [[62-df-real-code]]。$S\\in\\{\\mathbb Q,I\\}$ 为元层标签；两个载体及距离图在 Assertion 中定义。"},{"id":"a9b9b98944ad28e8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]，有理代码与运算见 [[62-df-rational-code]]。$x,y$ 为集合变量；以下不取所有实数代码的第三阶商集。数值函数应用均可还原为图成员。"},{"id":"5747f9579d6a8556","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$x,y$ 满足 $\\mathsf{Real}$，见 [[62-df-real-code]]；有理运算和 $\\varepsilon_k=2^{-k}$ 见 [[62-df-rational-code]]；总函数图见 [[62-df-coded-function]]。$\\widehat q$ 为有理数 $q\\in\\mathbb Q_c$ 的恒定实代码。以下操作是集合图的可定义缩写，不是新增的 $L_2$ 函数符号。"},{"id":"fa4f48bc86dadb9f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"编码、实数及有理数见 [[62-df-coded-function]]、[[62-df-real-code]]、[[62-df-rational-code]]。$F,g,x$ 为集合变量。$F_n$ 是 Assertion 中以图成员定义的截面。"},{"id":"48e6afe70e39f04a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal I$ 见 [[62-df-rational-metric-presentations]]，Net 见 [[62-df-metric-compact-net]]，$E(j)=2^j$、RatEq 与有理代码见 [[62-df-rational-code]]，配对和 Fun 见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；理论与可推导性见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-derivability]]。$r_{ij}=\\langle\\langle i,0\\rangle_N,E(j+1)\\rangle_N$。 本断言中的理论为 $\\mathrm{RCA}_0$。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-rational-code|Canonical Rational Number Codes]]"},{"id":"271bc9074a256041","anchor":"ref-277","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[62-df-rational-code]]"}],"outgoing":["c156c03daff0aff0","5b467a42733b7257","b7164631e6f56192","dd5e8930337c8b20","4c6d2d9f1999915f","98c3cbeb95500b53"]}